    "focusRingWidth": 2
  },
  "notes": [
    "ThunKaninchen chose CSS goldenrod for the shared accent, superseding the current Theme.kt amber. Do not overwrite app themes until the generated outputs are reviewed.",
    "textFaint is reserved for disabled or nonessential placeholder text; it fails normal text contrast.",
    "Category colors are supplementary; labels and shape communicate state.",
    "Validate font availability, contrast, focus, touch targets, and layouts on actual platforms before release.",
    "Category chip labels use text on their category color at 16% alpha over panel; category color is used for the wash, not the label. Check each wash against every surface on which it is used.",
    "textMuted on raised is not an approved normal-text combination; use text on raised."
  ],
